            "text": "A former personal trainer, she advocates for parents' rights.",
            "cites": [2]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Her campaign focuses on reading, writing and math, and opposing transgender girls competing on female athletic teams. She supported a policy requiring schools to inform parents if their child went by a different name or gender pronouns at school. She proposes pushing for fiscal transparency and fighting the restructuring of the state education department, and she plans to act as an independent check on the appointed education commissioner.",
